{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1978","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Computing Machine"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sasha has two binary strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ of the same length $$$n$$$, consisting of the characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is also a computing machine that can perform two types of operations on binary strings $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ of the same length $$$k$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$a_{i} = a_{i + 2} =$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", then you can assign $$$b_{i + 1} :=$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1 \\le i \\le k - 2$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$b_{i} = b_{i + 2} =$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", then you can assign $$$a_{i + 1} :=$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1 \\le i \\le k - 2$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sasha became interested in the following: if we consider the string $$$a=s_ls_{l+1}\\ldots s_r$$$ and the string $$$b=t_lt_{l+1}\\ldots t_r$$$, what is the maximum number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters in the string $$$a$$$ that can be obtained using the computing machine. Since Sasha is very curious but lazy, it is up to you to answer this question for several pairs $$$(l_i, r_i)$$$ that interest him."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^{4}$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains a binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of the characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of each test case contains a binary string $$$t$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of the characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The fourth line of each test case contains a single integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the following lines contains two integers $$$l_{i}$$$ and $$$r_{i}$$$ ($$$1 \\le l_{i} \\le r_{i} \\le n$$$) — the boundaries of the $$$i$$$-th pair of substrings that interest Sasha."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$ and the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output $$$q$$$ integers — the answers to all queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n4\n1111\n0000\n2\n1 2\n2 4\n4\n1010\n1101\n2\n1 3\n1 4\n6\n010101\n011010\n5\n2 3\n1 6\n2 5\n4 4\n3 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n3\n2\n3\n1\n4\n3\n1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the first query, $$$a =$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"11"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the maximum number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters is $$$2$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"chi